                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Search over 103 installed plugins. Results are a full-bleed grid: the cells stretch to fill the sheet rather than sitting at the fixed chip width, which on a 1880-wide sheet would strand two thirds of it empty. The keyboard\u2019s action key dismisses \u2014 there is nothing here to commit, since tapping a result is the commit. The header carries Rescan: a plugin installed after first boot could never appear without it. While a scan runs the control becomes a stop and the sheet shows its progress \u2014 a long scan must be interruptible."
